    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1587">

                <pb facs="1281" n="1165" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1165"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.001 P 82/3.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 220.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-10-02">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 2, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform the Department
                    that the inauguration of Dr. Belisario Porras as President of the Republic of
                    Panama occurred yesterday in a dignified and orderly manner and amid expressions
                    of genuine enthusiasm upon the part of both the number of those who were present
                    at the National Theater at the inaugural ceremony and by the populace assembled
                    in large numbers on the streets about the theater and the Presidential
                    Palace.</p>
                <p>The inaugural address contained very friendly and appreciative references to the
                    United States.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.],</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. Whiting Andrews.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
